@startuml
!theme blueprint

title llm-challenges Repository Overview

package "llm-challenges" as repo {
    file "README.md" as root_readme
    file "INSTRUCTIONS.md" as instructions
    file "package.json" as package_json
    file "package-lock.json" as lockfile

    package "challengeNN-<slug>/" as challenge {
        file "README.md\n(specification)" as challenge_readme
    }
}

root_readme -down-> instructions : tells agents to read
instructions -down-> challenge : defines the workflow
package_json -right-> lockfile : npm install
challenge_readme -down-> challenge : each challenge owns its spec

note right of challenge
  Challenge folders are represented generically so the diagram
  stays valid as new challenges are added.
end note

@enduml
